# The safety check: a changed comment is an internal error (exit 3), and
# nothing is written.
program Opp
arg --damage
arg 2
arg tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod
status 3
output
opp: internal error: tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod: the formatted text, at 1:1: the output has the comment (* X comment before the module *) where the input has the comment (* A comment before the module *); nothing written
